ect-And-Scene-Connection#SceneKit%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/05-SwiftUI-StateObject-And-Scene-Connection#SceneKit%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","url":"\/tutorials\/cube-one-stroke-puzzle-ko\/05-swiftui-stateobject-and-scene-connection#SceneKit%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"SceneKit에 전달하기","kind":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI에서 공유 view model 하나를 유지하고, 그 view model을 SceneKit view에 전달합니다."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section"},"doc://com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO/tutorials/CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO/SceneKit---":{"role":"article","kind":"article","title":"SceneKit 큐브","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/SceneKit---","abstract":[],"url":"\/tutorials\/cubeonestrokepuzzleko\/scenekit---"},"08-RotationModeGuard.swift":{"identifier":"08-RotationModeGuard.swift","type":"file","fileName":"SceneKitPuzzleViewModel.swift and ContentView.swift","content":["func setRotationModeEnabled(_ enabled: Bool) {","    if isRotationModeEnabled == enabled {","        return","    }","","    isRotationModeEnabled = enabled","","    let targetScale: CGFloat = enabled ? 0.82 : 1.0","    let scaleAction = SCNAction.scale(to: targetScale, duration: 0.18)","","    cubeNode.removeAction(forKey: \"rotationModeScale\")","    cubeNode.runAction(scaleAction, forKey: \"rotationModeScale\")","","    if enabled {","        debugText = \"회전 모드 ON: 드래그로 큐브를 돌려 다음 stage 면을 확인하세요.\"","    } else {","        debugText = \"회전 모드 OFF: 현재 stage 면을 터치해 경로를 이어갑니다.\"","    }","}","","private var rotationModeBinding: Binding<Bool> {","    Binding {","        viewModel.isRotationModeEnabled","    } set: { newValue in","        viewModel.setRotationModeEnabled(newValue)","    }","}","","Toggle(isOn: rotationModeBinding) {","    Label(\"회전 모드\", systemImage: \"rotate.le